            <p style="margin-bottom:11px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri Light&quot;,sans-serif">Please join us for the <strong>2026&nbsp;Santander International Banking Conference</strong>, to be held this year on <strong>Tuesday, November 3, at Santander headquarters in Boadilla del Monte, Madrid, 11.00 AM to 5.30 PM CET.</strong> Doors will open at 10.30 AM.</span></span></span></p>

<p style="margin-bottom:11px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri Light&quot;,sans-serif">Please fill in the following form to confirm your attendance. We look forward to seeing you.</span></span></span></p>
