<div class="register-form-field register-form-field-text_block col-md-12 mt-2 " id="field_011febe0-4054-45d5-91eb-da066974bab9">
    
            <p id="widget_7922ab7b-c1f6-4f3a-bc43-c34c39f311c4"><a href="https://myaccess.events/santanderibc2026/santander-international-banking-conference-2026/page/legal-disclaimer-and-general-terms" target="_blank"><span style="color:#c0392b;">LEGAL DISCLAIMER AND GENERAL TERMS</span></a></p>
    </div>



                                    </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        
                    
        
        <div class="register-form-field-container-wrapper" id="register-form-field-wrapper_a7d865d8-3880-4fe0-8b72-540704f588d1">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="form-row">
    
    
    
    
        <div class="form-group register-form-field register-form-field-terms_and_conditions col-md-12 " id="register-form-field_a7d865d8-3880-4fe0-8b72-540704f588d1">
    <div class="form-check">
        <input type="checkbox"
               id="register_form_a7d865d8-3880-4fe0-8b72-540704f588d1"
               name="register_form[a7d865d8-3880-4fe0-8b72-540704f588d1]"
                                    required="required"
                               class="form-check-input"
               value="1"
                                        >

        <label class="form-check-label required"
               for="register_form_a7d865d8-3880-4fe0-8b72-540704f588d1">
            <a href="#" data-toggle="modal" data-target="#modal-register_form_a7d865d8-3880-4fe0-8b72-540704f588d1" class="text-dark">
                Privacy Policy
            </a>
        </label>
    </div>

    <div class="modal fade" id="modal-register_form_a7d865d8-3880-4fe0-8b72-540704f588d1" tabindex="-1" role="dialog"
         aria-labelledby="register_form_a7d865d8-3880-4fe0-8b72-540704f588d1"
         aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="modal-dialog modal-lg" role="document">
            <div class="modal-content">
                <div class="modal-header">
                    <h5 class="modal-title">
                        2026 INTERNATIONAL BANKING CONFERENCE PRIVACY POLICY
                    </h5>
                    <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close">
                        <span aria-hidden="true">&times;</span>
                    </button>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-body">
                    <p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Banco Santander, S.A. will process all personal data provided or obtained in connection with the International Banking Conference, an event scheduled to take place </span><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">both physically</span><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"> and virtually</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">on&nbsp;3<sup>rd</sup>&nbsp;November 2026</span>&nbsp;<span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">at the Santander Group City in Boadilla del Monte, Madrid, (hereinafter, the &rdquo;Event&rdquo;) and whose final format will be the one considered most suitable for the organizers&rsquo; purpose. Against this backdrop, Banco Santander has implemented the necessary technical and organizational measures to safeguard all personal data it processes and to prevent their alteration, loss, unauthorized processing or access, given the capacity of the technology, the type of data held, and the risks to which they might be exposed, whether from direct human action or their physical and natural environments.</span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">In compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) 2016/679 (the General Data Protection Regulation, hereinafter the &ldquo;GDPR&rdquo;) and other applicable personal data protection laws, all subjects (hereinafter, a &ldquo;Data Subject&rdquo; or &ldquo;Data Subjects&rdquo;) whose data will be processed are hereby informed of the following essential aspects related to such processing:</span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px">&nbsp;</p>

<p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">I.- Party responsible for processing personal data </span></b></span></span></span></p>

<p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">The party responsible for processing the Data Subjects&rsquo; personal data is Banco Santander, S.A. (hereinafter, &ldquo;Banco Santander&rdquo;), with</span><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"> tax identification number A-39000013; registered office at </span><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Avenida de Cantabria s/n</span><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">,</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Ciudad Financiera</span><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">, 28660 - Boadilla del Monte, Madrid; and email address:</span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><a href="mailto:privacidadcomunicacionymarketingcorporativo@gruposantander.com" style="color:#0563c1; text-decoration:underline"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">privacidadcomunicacionymarketingcorporativo@gruposantander.com</span></a></span></span></span></p>

<p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px">&nbsp;</p>

<p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">II.- Banco Santander Data Protection Officer and contact details </span></b></span></span></span></p>

<p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">The Data Protection Officer is the person </span><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">directly in charge of ensuring GDPR compliance and who, in this case, guarantees the protection of all personal data that Banco Santander processes.</span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Anyone looking to enquire as to how Banco Santander processes their personal data can contact the Data Protection Officer directly at:</span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><a href="mailto:privacidad@gruposantander.es" style="color:#0563c1; text-decoration:underline"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">privacidad@gruposantander.es</span></a> </span></span></span></p>

<p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px">&nbsp;</p>

<p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">III.- Personal data processing</span></b></span></span></span></p>

<p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">The personal data that Banco Santander requests as part of Event registration forms and channels are essential to enable proper registration and attendance (whether in-person or virtual). As such, without this information, it would not be possible to process a User&rsquo;s request for registration.</span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Where a User provides third-party personal data, they tacitly undertake to notify the Data Subject(s) of the terms of this Privacy Policy in relation to the processing of said data, as well as to comply with any other legal requirements that may apply to entering personal data on the behalf of others for the purpose in question, in which case Banco Santander will not need to perform any further action as regards the Data Subjects.</span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Banco Santander may also process attendees&rsquo; images and/or voice, as well as their comments and opinions, to fulfil the purposes of data processing specified hereunder.</span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px">&nbsp;</p>

<p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">IV.- Purposes of personal data processing and legal grounds</span></b></span></span></span></p>

<ol style="list-style-type:lower-alpha">
	<li style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px; margin-left:8px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Registration and Event attendance management</span></b></span></span></span></span></li>
</ol>

<p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px; margin-left:48px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Banco Santander will use the Data Subjects&rsquo; data to manage their registration and attendance (whether in-person or virtual) at the Event.</span></span></span></span></p>

<ol start="2" style="list-style-type:lower-alpha">
	<li style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px; margin-left:8px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Interaction at the Event</span></b></span></span></span></span></li>
</ol>

<p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px; margin-left:48px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Throughout the Event sessions and via its numerous platforms, attendees can direct questions at speakers; cast votes in polls; and even communicate privately with other registered attendees.</span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">The legal grounds for this data processing is the correct performance of the contractual relationship between Banco Santander and the Data Subjects.</span></span></span></span></p>

<ol start="3" style="list-style-type:lower-alpha">
	<li style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px; margin-left:8px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Electronic issue of Event-specific information</span></b></span></span></span></span></li>
</ol>

<p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px; margin-left:48px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Banco Santander may use the Data Subjects&rsquo; details to send them information relating to the Event, or even to invite them to future editions. </span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px; margin-left:48px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">The legal grounds for sending such information is Banco Santander&rsquo;s legitimate interest in keeping Data Subjects informed of developments to do with the Event and any future editions thereof.</span></span></span></span></p>

<ol start="4" style="list-style-type:lower-alpha">
	<li style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px; margin-left:8px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Post-Event surveys</span></b></span></span></span></span></li>
</ol>

<p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px; margin-left:48px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">After the Event, Banco Santander may elect to send out surveys to obtain feedback on the Event from attendees. Survey participation shall be entirely voluntary.</span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="margin-left:47px; text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">The legal grounds for sending these surveys is Banco Santander&rsquo;s legitimate interest in receiving feedback from attendees as to their satisfaction with the Event.</span></span></span></span></p>

<ol start="5" style="list-style-type:lower-alpha">
	<li style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px; margin-left:8px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Recording Event sessions and using the recorded images on www.santander.com and Grupo Santander&#39;s social media profiles</span></b></span></span></span></span></li>
</ol>

<p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px; margin-left:48px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Throughout the event, Banco Santander may record audiovisual images to reproduce and publish them for information purposes on its website and social media profiles, as well as for internal use.</span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px; margin-left:48px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">The legal grounds for this data processing is Banco Santander&rsquo;s legitimate interest in informing the public about the Event and promoting it as the organizer thereof.</span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">As regards the legal grounds for the aforementioned image-data processing, Banco Santander conducted proportionality analyses to ensure that, based on its legitimate interests, this does not unfairly undermine the rights and freedoms of the Data Subjects involved. Nonetheless, in accordance with section VII of this Privacy policy, all Data Subjects are entitled to object to having their data processed for this purpose.</span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px">&nbsp;</p>

<p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">V.- Conservation of personal data</span></b></span></span></span></p>

<p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">All personal data provided will be stored for the duration of the Event and beyond for as long as necessary to fulfil the aforementioned purposes and provided that Data Subjects do not request they be deleted. Whenever such a circumstance arises, personal data will be blocked for three (3) years (specifically, so they remain available to refer to and use in exercising legal defence or undertaking appropriate legal actions), after which time they will be permanently deleted.</span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px">&nbsp;</p>

<p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">VI.- Sharing personal data and international data transfers</span></b></span></span></span></p>

<p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">As previously stated, certain images captured at the Event may contain personal data that should be considered purely incidental.</span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">As such, the purpose is not to disclose Data Subjects&rsquo; personal data to third parties, unless there is a requirement to do so in compliance with a specific legal mandate.</span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Notwithstanding the foregoing, Banco Santander vendors may have access to this data to allow for the proper fulfilment of the aforementioned purposes. Said vendors will not process this data for any purposes that Banco Santander has not been made aware of in advance. By way of</span><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"> example and without limitation,</span><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"> Banco Santander hires professional consulting, technological platform operation and repository services, as well as professional management services, to ensure that all Banco Santander business is conducted properly and in due compliance with the corporation&rsquo;s established legal obligations.</span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Banco Santander follows rigorous criteria when it comes to selecting service providers in order to ensure strict compliance with its data-protection obligations. All vendors must sign a data processing agreement as prescribed by law, which will impose on them the following obligations: enforce all due technical and organizational measures to ensure that personal data are kept safe; process personal data for the agreed purposes only and in strict accordance with the documented instructions of the </span><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Data Protection Officer</span><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">; and delete or return all data to Banco Santander as soon as the services end.</span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Should any services contracted by Banco Santander involve processing personal data from Data Subjects from outside the European Economic Area, operational guarantees are in place to ensure that this data shall be processed with all the necessary safeguards. For instance, the signing of standard data protection clauses or only working with service providers who are signatories to specific agreements that acknowledge and demand that appropriate levels of data protection be maintained (for example: the EU-US Data Privacy Framework).</span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px">&nbsp;</p>

<p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">VII.- Data Subjects&rsquo; rights</span></b></span></span></span></p>

<p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Any Data Subjects wishing at any given time to exercise their rights of access, rectification and erasure (or request specific restricted processing of their personal data; data portability; or who, despite Banco Santander&#39;s legitimate and declared purposes, object to having their personal data processed) may do so by sending a written communication to:</span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif">&nbsp;<a href="https://santandernet-my.sharepoint.com/personal/n734305_gruposantander_com/Documents/privacidadcomunicacionymarketingcorporativo@gruposantander.com" style="color:#0563c1; text-decoration:underline"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">privacidadcomunicacionymarketingcorporativo@gruposantander.com</span></a> </span></span></span></p>

<p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">or by post to: Avenida de Cantabria s/n, Ciudad Financiera, 28660, Boadilla del Monte, Madrid. </span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Data Subjects are entitled to consult all matters relating to the processing of their personal data with Banco Santander&#39;s Data Protection Officer by sending an email to </span><a href="mailto:privacidad@gruposantander.es" style="color:#0563c1; text-decoration:underline"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">privacidad@gruposantander.es</span></a><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">. </span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Notwithstanding any of the above, all Data Subjects are entitled to contact the Spanish Data Protection Agency via its website </span><a href="http://www.aepd.es" style="color:#0563c1; text-decoration:underline"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">www.aepd.es</span></a><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"> if at any time they believe that their personal data has not been processed properly or that their rights are not being suitably addressed.</span></span></span></span></p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>




                                    </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        
                    
        
        <div class="register-form-field-container-wrapper" id="register-form-field-wrapper_2c31099d-d5c0-42b9-a5d8-63480f3753ab">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="form-row">
    
    
    
    

<div  class="register-form-field register-form-field-separator invisible col-md-4 " id="field_2c31099d-d5c0-42b9-a5d8-63480f3753ab">
    <hr  style="color:transparent;" >
</div>

